All files within this directory should be PNGs

initial_models/ contains the output from combfits_to_png.sh. These
are the human-readable visualizations of the HAL models for each
seyfert.

The four below are all outputs from 
stacking_functions.saveResults(llh,jl,name)

residuals/ contains the model in counts space + the residual. 
This is the output from llh.display_spectrum().savefig(name_res.png)

spectra/ contains the fitted spectrum. This is the output from 
plot_spectra(jl.resutls).savefig(name_fit_spectrum.png)

energyplanes/ contains the energy planes (three columns: model, 
data, and residual). This is the output from 
llh.display_fit.savefig(name_fit_planes.png)

stacked/ contains the stacked image (?). Output from 
llh.display_stacked_image.savefig(name_stackedim.png)
